# Third-party code and runtime package licenses

## CalDAV parser history

server/calendar.js adapts the CalDAV parser and IANA timezone approach from
our own earlier implementation at
dashboard/worker/calendar.js in the deleted frame-dashboard working repository.
The source file was first added in commit
0e80c873a02ba23f23857d79a227a7f06458c3d9 ("Add authenticated iCloud calendar
API and secure local setup"). This is a historical pointer to personal work,
not a published-source URL. That file was absent from the verified Wes Bos
baseline, so this notice makes no Wes Bos authorship or license claim for the
parser. The current implementation in this project is adapted from that
personal work.

